beling"},{"text":"Medical terminology"},{"text":"Pharmacovigilance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 3 — Digital Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Basic Python/R"},{"text":"Document automation concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal should be regulatory expertise supported by data capability, rather than becoming a general-purpose programmer."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"M.Pharm — Regulatory Affairs"},{"type":"p","text":"One of the most directly aligned postgraduate choices where available."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory submissions"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical regulations"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Global regulatory affairs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Pharm — Pharmacology"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for strengthening:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drug safety"},{"text":"Pharmacology"},{"text":"Benefit-risk assessment"},{"text":"Pharmacovigilance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MSc Clinical Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Suitable for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical regulatory affairs"},{"text":"Clinical development"},{"text":"Clinical operations"},{"text":"Regulatory submissions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MSc Pharmacovigilance / Drug Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Where available, this can strengthen the pathway toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drug safety"},{"text":"PV-regulatory interface"},{"text":"Risk management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA — Pharmaceutical Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful later for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory leadership"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical strategy"},{"text":"Product management"},{"text":"Operations"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Global Regulatory Affairs"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"U